      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wimauma%2C_Florida",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wimauma incorporated in 1925 as Hillsborough County’s fourth municipality, but its city government dissolved in the 1930s, rendering the charter void after six decades.",
